          "settings": {
            "question": "How long before I notice a difference?",
            "answer": "<p>Most customers notice reduced bloating and smoother digestion within the first 1 to 2 weeks. Energy and clarity typically improve around weeks 3 to 6. For deeper liver support, 3 to 6 months of consistent use delivers the best results.†</p>"
