            "question": "Why should I choose the 2 or 3 bottle bundle?",
            "answer": "<p>Liver support is a process, not an event. The first 1 to 2 months start the clear. Deep cellular support happens from months 2 to 6. Most customers who report the biggest changes committed to at least a few months — and bundles give you the best price per bottle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes Nülive different from other milk thistle supplements?",
            "answer": "<p>Our milk thistle is standardized to 80% silymarin, the clinical threshold. We use 6 active ingredients that work together to support your body.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will this work if I've tried other supplements before?",
            "answer": "<p>Most liver supplements only address one piece of the problem. They either try to clear toxins or support liver health, but not both. Nülive's 6-ingredient formula was built to support the full cycle. That's why customers who gave up on other products often see results with Nülive.†</p>"
          }
        },
