          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I take it?",
            "answer": "<p>Take 1 capsule daily with water, preferably with a meal. For best results, take it at the same time each day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I take it with other supplements or medications?",
            "answer": "<p>Nülive works well alongside most everyday supplements. Milk thistle may interact with certain medications (such as blood thinners, some diabetes medications and immunosuppressants), so if you take prescription medication, are pregnant or nursing, please consult your doctor first. If you're allergic to plants in the daisy family (ragweed, marigolds), check with your doctor before use.</p>"
          }
        },
